{"game": "earth-defense-force-5", "language": "english", "appid": 1007040, "month": "2024-10", "window": 4, "start_date": 1729728000, "end_date": 1730419199, "month_true_total": 39, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-09-28 17:55:45 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "178067709", "author": {"steamid": "76561198055393253", "personaname": "squidfire", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198055393253/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 12, "playtime_forever": 3985, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 2279, "last_played": 1733420636, "avatar": "738345e90541ec9e092fdad6321ae639eed49e4b"}, "language": "english", "review": "A great game if you just want to kill some bugs and aliens. :)", "timestamp_created": 1730333518, "timestamp_updated": 1730333518, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "178021838", "author": {"steamid": "76561197995124351", "personaname": "demondude777", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/demondude777/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 581, "playtime_forever": 170, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 170, "deck_playtime_at_review": 2, "last_played": 1730273838, "avatar": "f65a4217fd37a04d62218780c932225db22f6345"}, "language": "english", "review": "SALE ONLY!!!!\n\nI gotta specify that because at $60 this would be a no. But on a sale if you don't have 4.1...it isn't a bad choice.\n\nThe game is more polished than 4.1 and Insect Armageddon....but the polish takes away from the imperfect fun of the last ones. There is a point when cleaning everything up makes it less desirable, and I think 5 found that point. Playing it just makes me want to go back to 4.1.\n\nThere is also some bad choices with mid mission cinematics....where the camera will change to focus on something happening (like a space ship arriving), but the action doesn't stop, and your controls are not adjusted for the camera change. So you won't be able to see what danger you are running head first into.\n\nI'v barely tried online with buddies, but had no problems. So if you have friends that are not close by, then you will able to get a lot of mileage out of it with them online. In face if you are picking this up for solo pay...don't bother.\n\nThis gets a thumbs up but it is such a light thumbs up...that if you have the choice to get this or 4.1...don't hesitate. Get 4.1. Its not as clean as 5, but much better.", "timestamp_created": 1730274427, "timestamp_updated": 1730274427, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503311276435852051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177813485", "author": {"steamid": "76561198006687940", "personaname": "InsideOut", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198006687940/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 93, "playtime_forever": 1999, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 1999, "last_played": 1729986090, "avatar": "dcc842540aede4b5e7d0963bd59ce22c7c406802"}, "language": "english", "review": "It's a lot like EDF 4.1, but slightly enhanced. A lot of shooting at monster and alien hordes, flattening whole building blocks  in the process. It's mindless fun especially in co-op, but when you've played an EDF game before the surprise is somewhat diminished when you notice how much of the content of previous games is being reused. It's decent, but nothing groundbreaking.\n\nAs a first EDF game to try out, this is a great entry point.\n\nRating: 7.0/10", "timestamp_created": 1729987119, "timestamp_updated": 1740096774, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.503311276435852051", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177738906", "author": {"steamid": "76561197985846432", "personaname": "King Ghidorah", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ssbmmaster0/", "num_games_owned": 1183, "num_reviews": 30, "playtime_forever": 1850, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 627, "last_played": 1784085533, "avatar": "a544d027996b4209e536a9df3a3d4022ba471809"}, "language": "english", "review": "Shoot many bug with friends again. Is still good game.", "timestamp_created": 1729898782, "timestamp_updated": 1729898782, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1562828575", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "177734428", "author": {"steamid": "76561198203277252", "personaname": "1V-4N", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198203277252/", "num_games_owned": 128, "num_reviews": 52, "playtime_forever": 234, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 234, "last_played": 1729892901, "avatar": "df07abf483630bb1302cc039fa4b30df1a153c6a"}, "language": "english", "review": "Haha funni bug go splat", "timestamp_created": 1729892916, "timestamp_updated": 1729892916, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_acce